Reused evidence already covering the gap areas: `E0087`, `E0088`, `E0089` for appointments; `E0090`, `E0091`, `E0093`, `E0094`, `E0095` for family-finance / concealment nexus; `E0096` as contrary evidence. The new round mainly tightens the Jair-specific nexus and broadens appointments beyond Petrobras.

SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Bolsonaro diz que alertou parentes sobre possivel busca e apreensao relacionada a compra de imoveis","publisher":"UOL / Reuters","publication_date":"2022-09-08","url":"https://economia.uol.com.br/noticias/reuters/2022/09/08/bolsonaro-diz-que-alertou-parentes-sobre-possivel-busca-e-apreensao-relacionada-a-compra-de-imoveis.htm","claim":"Bolsonaro said he warned relatives about a possible search-and-seizure operation tied to allegations about family property purchases and said such a move would create a media scandal.","locator":"opening paragraphs and quoted live-stream remarks","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Contemporaneous Reuters reporting based on Bolsonaro's own public remarks, with direct attribution but only self-report on the underlying allegation.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"direct 2022 conduct and response to scrutiny","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable because the warning and public framing came from Jair Bolsonaro; the underlying property-purchase allegation remains investigatory and family-linked rather than adjudicated as his personal wrongdoing.","contrary_evidence":["Bolsonaro denied irregularities and said 'money current' does not prove cash payments.","The article reports allegations, not a court finding."],"lenses":["7B.3","7B.4","7B.6","7B.7","7B.8","7B.10"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Federal Police Sees Suspicious Transactions in Bolsonaro's Office","publisher":"Folha","publication_date":"2022-09-27","url":"https://www1.folha.uol.com.br/internacional/en/brazil/2022/09/federal-police-sees-suspicious-transactions-in-bolsonaros-office.shtml","claim":"Federal Police analysis of messages on Mauro Cid's phone suggested fractional deposits and withdrawals intended to pay personal bills of Bolsonaro's family and people close to Michelle Bolsonaro.","locator":"paragraphs summarizing the PF analysis and quoted presidential office response","source_type":"media","source_confidence":"medium_high","source_confidence_reason":"Reuters-style reporting on a police investigation with specific facts, but still an allegation rather than a judicial finding.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"direct 2022 investigation","ruler_attribution":"Direct nexus to Jair Bolsonaro is plausible because the alleged transactions are tied to his office and family, but the source itself stops short of proving his personal order or benefit.","contrary_evidence":["The presidential office denied irregularities and said the money came from Bolsonaro's private account.","The article says the matter was under investigation without accusation or confirmation."],"lenses":["7B.4","7B.6","7B.7","7B.9"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Novos diretores(as) e ouvidor-geral da ANA sao nomeados e tomam posse","publisher":"Agencia Nacional de Aguas e Saneamento Basico (ANA)","publication_date":"2022-04-13","url":"https://www.gov.br/ana/pt-br/assuntos/noticias-e-eventos/noticias/novos-diretores-as-e-ouvidor-geral-da-ana-sao-nomeados-e-tomam-posse","claim":"Bolsonaro signed decrees naming a new ANA leadership team, including a former ANA director with engineering and water-governance experience, a public-management analyst, and a director with sectoral regulatory experience, for fixed mandates.","locator":"lines 389-413","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official agency notice with named appointees, mandate terms, and professional backgrounds directly tied to Bolsonaro's decrees.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"direct 2022 appointment action","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable because the appointments were signed by Jair Bolsonaro; the source also shows some appointees had prior technical or public-service experience, supporting competence rather than family favoritism.","contrary_evidence":["This is one agency and does not establish the whole patronage pattern by itself.","Some appointees were already inside the public sector, so the source supports competence more than novelty."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9"]}
SOURCE_CLAIM_JSON: {"title":"Jose Carlos Oliveira e o novo Ministro do Trabalho e Previdencia","publisher":"Ministerio do Trabalho e Emprego","publication_date":"2022-03-31","url":"https://www.gov.br/trabalho-e-emprego/pt-br/noticias-e-conteudo/Registros%20institucionais/2022/marco/jose-carlos-oliveira-e-o-novo-ministro-do-trabalho-e-previdencia/","claim":"Jose Carlos Oliveira, a career INSS public servant, was sworn in as Minister of Work and Previdencia in the presence of Bolsonaro and said he would continue and strengthen existing INSS policies through automation and better service.","locator":"headline, lead paragraph, and possession/continuity paragraphs","source_type":"official","source_confidence":"high","source_confidence_reason":"Official ministry notice of a sworn-in cabinet appointment with qualifications and policy intentions stated on the record.","final_evidence_use":"final_evidence","period_fit":"direct 2022 cabinet appointment","ruler_attribution":"Directly attributable because Bolsonaro was present and Oliveira assumed office under his government; the source supports a professional rather than purely loyalist appointment, but it does not by itself show broader cabinet quality.","contrary_evidence":["The page is an official self-description of continuity and competence, not an independent assessment of performance.","The page was only reachable as a search result snippet in this session, not as a full open page."],"lenses":["7B.5","7B.9"]}

Gap status:
- `7B.3` / `7B.4` self-dealing and concealment nexus: partly resolved.
- `7B.5` / `7B.9` appointment breadth: partly resolved.
- A definitive 2022 official asset-declaration, audit, or court finding directly tying Jair Bolsonaro to self-enrichment was not recovered in this round, so that part remains not recoverable from the material I found here.

Blockers:
- The TSE 2022 proposal PDF was discoverable through the open-data registry, but the ZIP fetch failed.
- One gov.br ministry page redirected to login on full open; I used the accessible search-result snippet instead.
